  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Response for US-bound Afghan Evacuees in Transit Center as Sayliyah in Doha, Qatar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to complement the United States (US) government&#x2019;s relocation efforts to support Afghan nationals and their families who are temporarily staying in Doha, Qatar. The overall objective of the project is to improve and strengthen the standards of protection through assistance, cultural and religious support, non-food item distribution and coordination, cultural orientation, medical referral assistance, airport assistance, and mental health and psychosocial support to vulnerable populations hosted in the facility, in Transit Center As Sayliyah near Doha, Qatar.</narrative>
  </description>
